        "original_id": "2b3a91c5-2f20-57e0-bb0c-b50283d94e4e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Samuel \"Sam\" Ervin Beam\n- Music artists: Iron & Wine, The Shins, The Postal Service\n- Albums and songs: Give Up, Such Great Heights, There's Never Enough Time, We Will Become Silhouettes\n- Companies: Sub Pop Records\n\nFacts:\n- Samuel \"Sam\" Ervin Beam was born on July 26, 1974.\n- Samuel \"Sam\" Ervin Beam is an American singer-songwriter who performs under the stage and recording name Iron & Wine.\n- The Postal Service released \"Such Great Heights\" as the lead single from their debut studio album Give Up on January 21, 2003 through Sub Pop Records.\n- The \"Such Great Heights\" single includes the previously unreleased track \"There's Never Enough Time.\"\n- The \"Such Great Heights\" single includes a cover of \"We Will Become Silhouettes\" by The Shins.\n- The \"Such Great Heights\" single includes a cover of \"Such Great Heights\" by Iron & Wine.",
